# Git attributes for walle.
#
# `git archive` honours export-ignore, so anything listed here stays in the
# repository (and therefore renders on GitHub) but is left out of release
# tarballs. That matters because the release archive is what a packager
# downloads: the README's demo GIFs are ~10 MB and nothing needs them to build.
#
# Rebuild an archive with:
#   git archive --format=tar.gz --prefix=walle-<version>/ -o walle-<version>.tar.gz <tag>
docs/ export-ignore
